# spec: docs/site-architecture.md §The license line — every README's License section and the site footer carry the one line scripts/license-line.conf renders for that site, every README carrying the heading is a declared site, no hand-written page under the declared pages root carries the heading, and every package manifest carrying a license field is declared there and states its license
